# Court witness (2026-10-01 consolidation). Positive fixture: residency, crypto, and tenant boundaries enforced.
@prefix dfcm: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/dfcm#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
dfcm:C010 dfcm:residencyEnforced true .
dfcm:C011 dfcm:encryptionAtRest true ; dfcm:encryptionInTransit true ; dfcm:keyIsolation true .
dfcm:C013 dfcm:tenantIsolation true ; dfcm:maxBlastRadiusPercent 5 .
